    "title": "6 Life Lessons To Learn From Shah Rukh Khan",
    "text": "Yellow Star\nYellow Star\n6 Life Lessons To Learn From Shah Rukh Khan\nProducer: Bhaswati Sengupta\nEditor: Aparna Singh | September 24, 2025\nBelieve in Yourself – Confidence is key to overcoming obstacles.\nShah Rukh Khan\nWork Hard, Stay Humble – Success comes with dedication and humility.\nShah Rukh Khan\nEmbrace Failures – Every setback is a setup for a stronger comeback.\nShah Rukh Khan\nFollow Your Passion – Love what you do and give it your all.\nShah Rukh Khan\nBe Kind and Respectful – Treat everyone with dignity, regardless of status.\nShah Rukh Khan\nStay Persistent – Never give up, even\nwhen the odds are against you.\nShah Rukh Khan\nYou may also like\n71st National Film Awards:\nComplete List Of Winners",
